   $$given a described shadow AI situation, determines what awareness and acceptable-use response would address it, and rejects a response that would drive adoption further underground.$$,
   $$responds to non-compliance by diagnosing the need behind it.$$, 37),
  ('7efd88a9-5d49-4bbe-9b94-3129d0bb0ff4', '0bb3878a-fb89-455d-a84c-bdb9a26b1643', '0e9200c0-a253-4489-9fa0-ac2b819c23bc', '4.11',
   $$Explain the physical controls theme, and why AI does not materially change it.$$,
   'medium'::criticality, 'per_exam'::task_frequency, '2_understand'::bloom_level,
   true, false,
   $$the physical theme and its control families, and the reasoning that establishes AI does not materially change them.$$,
   $$explains what the physical theme governs, and states why AI adoption does not alter these controls where a candidate might expect it to.$$,
   $$distinguishes a control genuinely affected by a technology shift from one merely adjacent to it.$$, 38),
  ('d3fa6fc7-953d-4ec7-bfa3-4140f1f7478b', '0bb3878a-fb89-455d-a84c-bdb9a26b1643', '0e9200c0-a253-4489-9fa0-ac2b819c23bc', '4.12',
   $$Explain the technological controls theme - logging, cryptography, secure development, data leakage prevention.$$,
   'high'::criticality, 'weekly'::task_frequency, '2_understand'::bloom_level,
   true, false,
   $$the technological theme - logging and monitoring, cryptography, secure development, data leakage prevention.$$,
   $$explains what each control family addresses and how they interact.$$,
   $$reads technical controls as a layered set rather than a product list.$$, 39),
  ('39a181e5-151f-421b-b56e-a7e0e3631f94', '0bb3878a-fb89-455d-a84c-bdb9a26b1643', '0e9200c0-a253-4489-9fa0-ac2b819c23bc', '4.13',
