   $$applies handling rules at the moment of the decision rather than after it.$$, 40),
  ('29725923-ec51-4c29-9b90-7ed907d05f89', '0bb3878a-fb89-455d-a84c-bdb9a26b1643', '47c51bc6-4af0-4f72-9ecd-52e133c0413d', '5.1',
   $$Explain monitoring, measurement, analysis and evaluation under clause 9.1.$$,
   'high'::criticality, 'weekly'::task_frequency, '2_understand'::bloom_level,
   true, false,
   $$what must be monitored and measured, by what methods, and what effectiveness means.$$,
   $$explains why measuring activity is not measuring effectiveness, and what makes an indicator useful.$$,
