   $$Recognize the certification process - stage 1, stage 2, surveillance and the three-year cycle.$$,
   'high'::criticality, 'per_exam'::task_frequency, '1_remember'::bloom_level,
   true, false,
   $$the two audit stages, surveillance, and the three-year cycle.$$,
   $$states what happens at each stage and the sequence they occur in.$$,
