   $$distinguishes certification from accreditation; explains what a certificate does and does not claim.$$,
   $$reads a credential claim precisely rather than by impression.$$, 46),
  ('9501b6bd-e231-469f-90e9-760c07d1dd6f', '0bb3878a-fb89-455d-a84c-bdb9a26b1643', '47c51bc6-4af0-4f72-9ecd-52e133c0413d', '5.7',
   $$Apply incident-response reasoning to a described AI-related security incident.$$,
   'high'::criticality, 'occasional'::task_frequency, '3_apply'::bloom_level,
   true, false,
   $$the incident-response process, AI-specific incident classes, and containment where the component acts autonomously.$$,
