   $$given an AI-related incident that went undetected, identifies why the monitoring in place could not have surfaced it.$$,
   $$recognizes that absence of alerts is not evidence of absence of incident.$$, 48),
  ('90482eeb-5d2f-4b72-98ca-8c77b5cb88fe', '0bb3878a-fb89-455d-a84c-bdb9a26b1643', '47c51bc6-4af0-4f72-9ecd-52e133c0413d', '5.9',
   $$Explain how ISO/IEC 42001 relates to an ISMS and why organizations increasingly operate both.$$,
   'medium'::criticality, 'per_exam'::task_frequency, '2_understand'::bloom_level,
   true, false,
